1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
过年那盘饺子，藏着心愿
The New Year plate holds a wish

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,400
"饺子"谐音"交子"
"Jiǎozi" sounds like "jiāozi"

3
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:06,600
新旧年，在子时相交
Old and new year meet at midnight

4
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:08,800
形状像元宝，招财进宝
Shaped like ingots — fortune in

5
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:11,000
有人包硬币，吃到就发财
A hidden coin: bite it, prosper

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,200
传说张仲景，冬至舍"娇耳"
Legend: Zhang Zhongjing's jiao'er

7
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,400
羊肉药材包成耳朵治冻疮
Ear-shaped, to cure frostbite

8
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:17,600
"娇耳"叫着，成了饺子
"Jiao'er" slowly became "jiaozi"

9
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:19,800
如今一年吃掉两百多万吨
Now: 2M+ tonnes a year

10
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:22,000
威海的海、东北的酸、成都的辣
The sea, the sour, the heat

11
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,200
千种馅，都回到一盘团圆
A thousand fillings, one reunion

12
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:26,400
你家过年，包什么馅？
What's your family's filling?

